  "Third-Party Components" means the software components, libraries, fonts
and images included in the Software that are copyrighted by others and are
licensed under their own license terms.

  "Simulation Kernel" means the OMNeT++ or OMNEST discrete event simulation
framework, which is distributed separately from the Software.

  "Noncommercial Purposes" means teaching and academic research at
universities, colleges and other educational institutions, and personal
non-profit purposes. If research is developed for later use by, or in
